{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52753","headline":"驾幸华清宫赋附歌 · 韩休","name":"驾幸华清宫赋附歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"素秋归兮玄冬早，王是时兮出西镐。\n幸华清兮顺天道，琼楼架虚兮灵仙保，长生殿前兮树难老，甘泉流兮圣躬可澡，俾吾皇兮亿千寿考。\n（见《文苑英华》卷五八）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52753.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52753","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}